        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPW-200, Small Traditional Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlthough essentially traditional in design, this 2 Inch Wire Ring Pull has a square mount that adds a bit of the unexpected. The Traditional 2 Inch Ring Pull is great for small drawers and doors like those found in kitchens, on bathroom vanities, and on furniture. It is easy to install with the included screw. Available in 5 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Smaller <a href=\"/products/traditional-3-inch-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpw-300\">Traditional 3\" Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RPW200 Wire Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Cutout: 1-11-32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
